<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hant"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>DotAI · 社交圖片拼圖</title><style>__EDITOR_CSS__</style></head><body>
<header><div class="brand-lockup"><img class="brand-logo" src="__BRAND_LOGO__" alt="DotAI" width="56" height="56"><div><p class="product-name">DOTAI COLLAGE STUDIO</p><h1>社交圖片拼圖</h1><p class="header-note">直接拖動 · 品牌標誌 · 下載 JPG</p></div></div><div class="header-actions"><button id="export-top" class="primary" disabled>下載 JPG ↗</button></div></header>
<main>
<aside class="panel left"><p class="section-kicker">01 / 排版</p><label class="ratio-row">尺寸<select id="ratio"><option value="1:1">1:1 正方形</option><option value="4:5">4:5 IG 直向</option></select></label><h2>揀一個排版</h2><div id="layouts" class="layouts"></div><details><summary>作品底色及留白</summary><div id="swatches" class="swatches" role="group" aria-label="作品底色"></div><label class="color-wrap">自訂底色<input id="bg-color" type="color" value="#FFFFFF" aria-label="自訂作品底色"></label><button id="save-color" class="secondary full">儲存目前底色</button><div id="saved-colors" class="swatches saved-colors" aria-label="已儲存底色"></div><label class="range-label">外框 <output id="margin-value">18 px</output></label><input id="margin" type="range" min="0" max="64" value="18"><label class="range-label">間距 <output id="gap-value">12 px</output></label><input id="gap" type="range" min="0" max="48" value="12"></details></aside>
<section class="stage"><div class="stage-top"><span id="layout-name">直接拖動</span><span id="size-label">1:1 · 1080 × 1080</span></div><div id="canvas-wrap" class="canvas-wrap"><canvas id="canvas" width="1080" height="1080" tabindex="0" aria-label="拖相片內部調整構圖；拖選框左上角移動相框，右下角改大小。"></canvas><img id="initial-preview" class="initial-preview" src="__PREVIEW_DATA__" alt="拼圖預覽"><canvas id="edit-overlay" width="1080" height="1080" aria-hidden="true"></canvas></div><p class="stage-caption">拖相片調構圖；拖框左上角移位，右下角改大小。四格模式可拖分界點做斜切。</p><div class="toolbar"><button id="undo" class="secondary" disabled>↶ 復原</button><button id="redo" class="secondary" disabled>↷ 重做</button><button id="reset" class="secondary">重設</button></div><div id="status" class="toast" role="status"></div></section>
<aside class="panel right"><p class="section-kicker">02 / 相片與品牌</p><h2>揀相片</h2><div id="photos" class="photo-list"></div><label class="replace-label upload-photo">＋ 上載／換入已選相片<input id="files" class="file-input" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><details open><summary>相片構圖</summary><label class="range-label">縮放 <output id="zoom-value">100%</output></label><div class="zoom-actions"><button id="zoom-out" class="secondary" aria-label="縮小已選相片">− 縮小</button><button id="zoom-in" class="secondary" aria-label="放大已選相片">＋ 放大</button></div><input id="zoom" type="range" min="100" max="300" value="100"><button id="center" class="secondary full">相片置中</button></details><details open><summary>作品標誌</summary><p class="small-note">上載後只在本機處理。PNG 透明背景效果最好。</p><label class="replace-label">＋ 上載正方形標誌<input id="logo-square" class="file-input" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><img id="logo-square-preview" class="logo-preview square" alt="正方形標誌預覽" hidden><button id="logo-square-remove" class="secondary full" disabled>移除正方形標誌</button><label class="replace-label">＋ 上載全名標誌<input id="logo-wordmark" class="file-input" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><img id="logo-wordmark-preview" class="logo-preview wordmark" alt="全名標誌預覽" hidden><button id="logo-wordmark-remove" class="secondary full" disabled>移除全名標誌</button><label class="range-label">品牌排版<select id="brand-placement"><option value="none">不放標誌</option><option value="corner">正方形：左上角</option><option value="top">全名：中上白條</option><option value="bottom">全名：中下白條</option></select></label><label class="range-label">標誌大小</label><input id="brand-size" type="range" min="6" max="40" value="24"><label class="range-label">邊距</label><input id="brand-padding" type="range" min="12" max="64" value="24"></details><button id="export-bottom" class="primary full" disabled>下載 JPG ↗</button><a id="download-fallback" hidden>再下載 JPG</a></aside>
</main><script id="photo-data" type="application/json">__PHOTO_DATA__</script><script>__BRAND_JS__</script><script>__CORE_JS__</script><script>__APP_JS__</script></body></html>
